    "detailed_description": "<h1>Controllers Available!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093910/extras/f881b41c0988142491a6f05bb470f140.avif?t=1748915143\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093910/extras/94f332f51759bd762a65c2aad47d6c55.avif?t=1748915143\" /></div><u><strong></strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093910/extras/5e96c0223c9d2c5d41c3d0d60fed1d67.webp?t=1748915143\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093910/extras/0f3aa73a745365bea4cfa3a10ddc1306.avif?t=1748915143\" /></div><strong>Lead four Time Walkers to torture the Dark Lord and his subordinates with more than 80 skills. Match different skill builds without class limits. Archer healer, assassin tank or wizard warrior? All up to you.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093910/extras/7eb79409589794a15bdb53f2e35fb7ff.poster.avif?t=1748915143\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093910/extras/7eb79409589794a15bdb53f2e35fb7ff.webm?t=1748915143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093910/extras/7eb79409589794a15bdb53f2e35fb7ff.mp4?t=1748915143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar